00:40:46,060 --> 00:40:51,340
much better, well, maybe.

776
00:40:51,340 --> 00:40:52,790
So another factor of three.

777
00:40:56,030 --> 00:40:57,970
OK, another factor of three.

778
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:04,190
Hmm, another factor of three.

779
00:41:08,150 --> 00:41:10,920
Some of you close may hear that
