00:41:28,740 --> 00:41:30,020
Here's my answer.

791
00:41:30,020 --> 00:41:32,840
How do they match or mismatch?

792
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:34,250
Is it an angle controller?

793
00:41:34,250 --> 00:41:34,910
Yes or no?

794
00:41:34,910 --> 00:41:36,555
Yes.

795
00:41:36,555 --> 00:41:37,930
AUDIENCE: Didn't
we just do this?

796
00:41:37,930 --> 00:41:40,130
DENNIS FREEMAN: Yeah,
it's an angle controller.

797
00:41:40,130 --> 00:41:43,030
What's different about this
