798
00:41:47,258 --> 00:41:48,540
AUDIENCE: There's oscillation.

799
00:41:48,540 --> 00:41:50,040
DENNIS FREEMAN:
There's oscillation.

800
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:52,360
Right, this thing,
turn it back on.

801
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:54,580
Let the thing kill itself.

802
00:41:54,580 --> 00:41:56,280
There's an oscillation.

803
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:59,646
Turn the gain down so it doesn't
